        <name>sstep_topology</name>
        <enumvalue id="group__sstep__defs_1ggabd2c373f4d8a7502c78952555c8cb23caa58189b3725d33b3e2e45e5de1edea0b" prot="public">
          <name>SSTEP_TOPOLOGY_FULL_BRIDGE</name>
          <initializer>= 0</initializer>
          <briefdescription>
<para>Two full H-bridges, 4 legs. </para>
          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>Phase A between legs 0 and 1, phase B between legs 2 and 3. Phase voltage range: -Vbus..+Vbus for each phase independently. </para>
          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
        <enumvalue id="group__sstep__defs_1ggabd2c373f4d8a7502c78952555c8cb23cad79082b32238cad97b34ad994c7a156b" prot="public">
          <name>SSTEP_TOPOLOGY_SHARED_LEG</name>
          <initializer>= 1</initializer>
          <briefdescription>
<para>Three half-bridges, 3 legs. </para>
          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>Phase A between legs 0 and 2, phase B between legs 1 and 2; leg 2 is shared and carries iA + iB. Phase voltages are limited by |vA|, |vB|, |vA - vB| &lt;= Vbus (sinusoidal amplitude about Vbus / sqrt(2)). </para>
          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Power stage topology. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
        </detaileddescription>
