    <briefdescription>
<para>Constants shared by the public API. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Units.</bold> Configuration values are integers in engineering units (milliohm, microhenry, milliampere, millivolt, hertz, nanosecond) so that <ref refid="group__sstep__api_1ga860a37e9ab847bb02f4102e98ea92e1c" kindref="member">sstep_init()</ref> needs no floating point with the fixed point backend. The unit is part of every field name (<computeroutput>r_mohm</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>l_uh</computeroutput>...). Positions are in microsteps, velocities in microsteps per second.</para>
<para><bold>Sign convention.</bold> A positive phase voltage drives a positive phase current; positive velocity increases the position. Phase A leads phase B by 90 electrical degrees for positive motion. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
